    <briefdescription>
<para>Axis-aligned rectangle in normalized [0, 1]^2 domain/UV space. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents the parametric sub-region of a tile or <ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref> within the unit terrain domain. (Halo cells may extend slightly outside [0, 1].) </para>
